  n106 -> n110 [label="pinyin\\n[TEXT]", color="#D97706", fontcolor="#D97706", penwidth=1.2, tooltip="text: /wiki/Fengdu_County\\nFengdu County ( Chinese : 丰都县 ; pinyin : Fēngdū Xiàn ; formerly Chinese : 酆都县 ; pinyin : Fēngdū Xiàn ) is a county located in Chongqing Municipality , People 's Republic of China . The county was established as Fengdu County ( 豐都縣 ) during the Sui Dynasty . The name was changed to Fengdu County ( 酆都縣 ) during the Ming Dynasty . In 1958 , the name was changed back to Fengdu County ( 豐都縣 ) ."];
